# Kept LF on every checkout, Windows included (core.autocrlf): release.yml's Windows leg runs
# scripts/third-party-notices.sh through Git Bash, where CRLF breaks its `#!/bin/sh` and `set -eu` lines,
# and renders about.hbs, whose lines would otherwise end CRLF among the LF license texts.
*.sh text eol=lf
about.hbs text eol=lf
